      "prevailing_wage_basis": "No program rule found. Housing Element Program H-CC (HCD review draft) is silent on prevailing wage and St. Helena has not adopted written fee relief criteria. Reduced, deferred or waived fees are public funds under Labor Code 1720(b)(4), but coverage depends on 1720(c) exemptions and project facts, such as (c)(3) de minimis, (c)(5)(E) for qualifying below-market loans, and the other public funds in the deal (trust fund, Measure E). https://www.hcd.ca.gov/housing-elements/docs/saint-helena-6th-draft090722.pdf ; https://california.public.law/codes/labor_code_section_1720",
